<title>SOUTH KOREA: RESEARCH ALERT - Samsung Heavy rated &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Samsung Heavy rated &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING-Barings Securities said on Wednesday it was upgrading its recommendation on Samsung Heavy Industries to a &quot;buy&quot; from a &quot;hold&quot; on the back of sharply improving earnings and cash flow, especially in 1999-2000.</p>
<p>ING-Barings said there was still good upside potential of 20-30 percent over the next six months as the improvement in 1999-2000 earnings had not yet been fully discounted.</p>
</text>
